{"seq":3,"slug":"query-strategies-overview","title":"查询策略概览","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/active-learning-data-labeling/foundations/query-strategies-overview","wordCount":1671,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"查询策略概览\">查询策略概览</h1><p>主动学习循环里那个被刻意留空的 <code>score</code> 函数，是整个系统成败的关键。给定一个未标样本，它该返回一个「值得标的程度」分数——但「值得」可以有完全不同的解读：是模型最拿不准的？是跟已标数据最不一样的？是几个模型吵得最凶的？还是标了之后预期误差降得最多的？每种解读对应一个查询策略家族。这一篇是全景地图，把这些家族分门别类、讲清它们各自盯着什么、彼此如何取舍，并指明每一类在「策略」章的哪一篇深讲。它是索引，不是深潜——具体公式留给后面。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>查询策略要回答「这个样本的信息量有多大」。信息量有两个正交的来源：样本本身让模型有多困惑（informativeness），以及样本对整个数据分布有多代表（representativeness）。几乎所有策略都落在这张二维图谱的某处。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[查询策略&lt;br/&gt;给未标样本打信息量分] --&gt; B[基于困惑度&lt;br/&gt;informativeness]&#10;  A --&gt; C[基于代表性&lt;br/&gt;representativeness]&#10;  B --&gt; D[不确定性采样&lt;br/&gt;单模型置信度]&#10;  B --&gt; E[委员会查询 QBC&lt;br/&gt;多模型分歧]&#10;  B --&gt; F[期望模型变化 / 误差缩减&lt;br/&gt;看标后影响]&#10;  C --&gt; G[多样性 / 密度加权&lt;br/&gt;覆盖分布]&#10;  D --&gt; H[混合策略&lt;br/&gt;困惑度 × 代表性]&#10;  G --&gt; H\">flowchart TD\n  A[查询策略&lt;br/&gt;给未标样本打信息量分] --&gt; B[基于困惑度&lt;br/&gt;informativeness]\n  A --&gt; C[基于代表性&lt;br/&gt;representativeness]\n  B --&gt; D[不确定性采样&lt;br/&gt;单模型置信度]\n  B --&gt; E[委员会查询 QBC&lt;br/&gt;多模型分歧]\n  B --&gt; F[期望模型变化 / 误差缩减&lt;br/&gt;看标后影响]\n  C --&gt; G[多样性 / 密度加权&lt;br/&gt;覆盖分布]\n  D --&gt; H[混合策略&lt;br/&gt;困惑度 × 代表性]\n  G --&gt; H</pre><p>最右下角的「混合策略」是 2026 年的实践主流：单看困惑度容易扎堆挑到边界上一小撮相似样本，单看代表性又会标到一堆模型早就会的简单样本，把两者相乘才能挑出「既不确定又有代表性」的样本。下表是四大家族的速览，作为后续章节的导航。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略家族</th>\n<th>盯着什么</th>\n<th>计算成本</th>\n<th>主要风险</th>\n<th>深讲位置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>不确定性采样</td>\n<td>单模型预测置信度</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>扎堆、对校准敏感</td>\n<td><a href=\"../strategies/uncertainty-sampling\">不确定性采样</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>委员会查询 QBC</td>\n<td>多模型预测分歧</td>\n<td>中（需多模型）</td>\n<td>委员会构建成本</td>\n<td>本篇下文概述</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多样性 / 代表性</td>\n<td>样本对分布的覆盖</td>\n<td>中（需算距离）</td>\n<td>忽略困惑度</td>\n<td><a href=\"../strategies/diversity-representativeness\">多样性与代表性</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>期望误差缩减</td>\n<td>标后对泛化误差的预期影响</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>计算几乎不可行</td>\n<td>本篇下文概述</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"不确定性与困惑度家族\">不确定性与困惑度家族</h2><p>最直觉的策略：挑模型最拿不准的样本。「拿不准」有三种常见度量——预测概率最高那类也不够高（least confidence）、最高两类概率挨得太近（margin）、整个预测分布的熵很大（entropy）。在深度学习里，单次前向的 softmax 置信度常常过度自信，于是有了贝叶斯味的 BALD，用多次带 dropout 的前向之间的分歧来估计「认知不确定性」。这一整套是「策略」章第一篇的主题，这里只点出它们共同的软肋：都依赖模型置信度本身是可信的，而神经网络的置信度往往校准很差。详见 <a href=\"../strategies/uncertainty-sampling\">不确定性采样</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"委员会查询-用分歧代替置信度\">委员会查询：用分歧代替置信度</h2><p>委员会查询（Query-By-Committee, QBC）绕开了「单模型置信度不可信」的问题：训练一组有差异的模型（不同初始化、不同子集、不同架构），让它们各自预测，挑它们吵得最凶的样本。直觉是——如果一群不同的模型对某样本意见一致，它大概很好学；如果吵翻天，它就处在假设空间的争议地带，标了能消除最多的不确定性。</p>\n<p>分歧的常见度量是投票熵（vote entropy）和平均 KL 散度。设委员会有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 个模型，样本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 上第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 个模型的预测分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_c(y|x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，共识分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>P</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{P}(y|x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0701em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，则平均 KL 分歧为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>KL</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>C</mi></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>C</mi></munderover><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mtext> </mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>P</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{\\text{KL}} = \\frac{1}{C} \\sum_{c=1}^{C} \\mathrm{KL}\\big(P_c(y|x) \\,\\|\\, \\bar{P}(y|x)\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">KL</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0954em;vertical-align:-1.2671em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">KL</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>QBC 的代价是要维护一个委员会——训练和推理成本乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>。在深度学习里这很贵，所以常用 dropout 或快照集成（snapshot ensemble）来廉价地近似一个委员会，这条思路和 BALD 其实殊途同归。</p>\n<h2 id=\"期望模型变化与误差缩减\">期望模型变化与误差缩减</h2><p>最理论上正确的策略不问「样本现在多困惑」，而问「标了它之后，模型会变好多少」。期望模型变化（Expected Model Change）挑那些标了之后会让模型参数动得最多的样本；期望误差缩减（Expected Error Reduction）更直接，挑那些标了之后预期能把整个未标池的泛化误差降得最多的样本。</p>\n<p>它的问题是计算几乎不可行：要评估一个候选样本，你得假设它每种可能的标签、各自重训一遍模型、再在整池上估误差，复杂度是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>U</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>Y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>×</mo><mtext>训练成本</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(|U| \\times |Y| \\times \\text{训练成本})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">训练成本</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。在深度学习里这等于做梦。所以它主要作为理论标杆存在，实践中用各种近似（如只看梯度范数作为「模型变化」的代理）来逼近，这层近似又把它和不确定性采样连了起来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"怎么选-一张决策清单\">怎么选：一张决策清单</h2><p>没有放之四海皆准的策略，选择取决于约束。下面这张清单概括了实践中的选型逻辑。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>你的约束</th>\n<th>推荐起点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>算力紧、要快上线</td>\n<td>熵不确定性采样，最简单有效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型置信度校准差（深度网络）</td>\n<td>BALD 或委员会查询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据有明显聚类、怕扎堆</td>\n<td>多样性加权或混合策略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类别严重不平衡</td>\n<td>混合策略 + 显式覆盖稀有类</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一次要挑一大批</td>\n<td>BADGE 等批量感知策略</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实践建议：先用最简单的熵不确定性采样跑通循环、建立基线，再视症状升级——发现扎堆就加多样性，发现置信度不可信就换 BALD 或委员会。批量场景几乎总要专门的批量策略，否则一批里全是相似样本，见 <a href=\"../strategies/batch-mode-active\">批量主动学习</a>。值得一提，模型不确定性的估计本身也是 <a href=\"../../explainable-ai/foundations/why-interpretability\">可解释 AI</a> 关心的问题，两个领域共享很多工具。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>查询策略给样本打「信息量分」，信息量有困惑度和代表性两个正交来源。</li>\n<li>四大家族：不确定性采样（单模型置信度）、委员会查询（多模型分歧）、多样性/代表性（覆盖分布）、期望误差缩减（理论标杆）。</li>\n<li>委员会查询用分歧绕开「单模型置信度不可信」，代价是维护一个委员会。</li>\n<li>期望误差缩减最理论正确但计算不可行，实践靠梯度等代理近似。</li>\n<li>选型逻辑：从熵不确定性起步建基线，再按扎堆/校准/不平衡等症状升级到混合或批量策略。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 内：<a href=\"../strategies/uncertainty-sampling\">不确定性采样</a>——困惑度家族的深潜；<a href=\"../strategies/diversity-representativeness\">多样性与代表性</a>——代表性家族的深潜。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../explainable-ai/foundations/why-interpretability\">为何要可解释性</a>——不确定性估计在可解释 AI 中的共享工具。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"查询策略概览","id":"查询策略概览"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"不确定性与困惑度家族","id":"不确定性与困惑度家族"},{"level":2,"text":"委员会查询：用分歧代替置信度","id":"委员会查询-用分歧代替置信度"},{"level":2,"text":"期望模型变化与误差缩减","id":"期望模型变化与误差缩减"},{"level":2,"text":"怎么选：一张决策清单","id":"怎么选-一张决策清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"主动学习循环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/active-learning-data-labeling/foundations/active-learning-loop"},"next":{"title":"不确定性采样","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/active-learning-data-labeling/strategies/uncertainty-sampling"}}